+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's cache eviction policy is Least Recently Used (LRU) with a 300-second time-to-live (TTL) for cache entries: entries are evicted based on access recency, and any entry is also removed once it exceeds the 300-second TTL, ensuring time-bounded freshness of cached data.
